#: ../../doc/old/old/read/source-map/parse-source-map.ipynb:10002
msgid "源码映射"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/source-map/parse-source-map.ipynb:10004
msgid ""
"`tvm/include/tvm/ir/source_map.h` "
"定义从源名称映射到源代码的映射（map）机制。这样的映射通常用于在编译过程中进行调试或生成代码的文档。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/source-map/parse-source-map.ipynb:20002
msgid "`SourceName` 和 `SourceNameNode`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/source-map/parse-source-map.ipynb:20004
msgid "`SourceName` 表示文件源代码名称的类。它继承自 `ObjectRef` 类，并具有以下成员变量和方法："
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/source-map/parse-source-map.ipynb:20005
msgid "`String name`：源代码的名称。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/source-map/parse-source-map.ipynb:20006
msgid ""
"`TVM_DLL static SourceName Get(const String& "
"name)`：静态方法，用于根据给定的操作符名称获取对应的 `SourceName` 对象。如果该名称未注册，则会引发错误。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/source-map/parse-source-map.ipynb:20008
msgid "`SourceNameNode` 是表示源代码片段名称的节点类。它继承自 `Object` 类，并具有以下成员变量和方法："
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/source-map/parse-source-map.ipynb:20009
msgid "`String name`：源代码片段的名称。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/source-map/parse-source-map.ipynb:20010
#: ../../doc/old/old/read/source-map/parse-source-map.ipynb:30010
msgid "`void VisitAttrs(AttrVisitor* v)`：访问者方法，用于在属性访问期间处理属性访问。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/source-map/parse-source-map.ipynb:20011
msgid ""
"`bool SEqualReduce(const SourceNameNode* other, SEqualReducer equal) "
"const`：静态成员函数，用于比较两个 `SourceNameNode` 对象的名称是否相等。它接受一个指向另一个 "
"`SourceNameNode` 对象的指针和一个相等性比较器作为参数，并返回一个布尔值表示比较结果。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/source-map/parse-source-map.ipynb:20012
msgid ""
"`static constexpr const char* _type_key = "
"\"SourceName\"`：静态常量字符指针，用于标识该类的类型键。"
msgstr ""

