#: ../../doc/old/old/read/source-map/parse-source-map.ipynb:60008
msgid "`_type_key`：静态常量字符指针，用于标识该类的类型键。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/source-map/parse-source-map.ipynb:50010
msgid ""
"`TVM_DECLARE_FINAL_OBJECT_INFO(SourceNode, Object)`：宏定义，用于声明 `SourceNode`"
" 类的最终对象信息。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/source-map/parse-source-map.ipynb:50012
msgid "`Source`类表示一个程序源代码的引用，继承自 `ObjectRef` 类。它具有以下成员变量和方法："
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/source-map/parse-source-map.ipynb:50013
msgid ""
"`Source(SourceName src_name, std::string source)`：构造函数，接受 `SourceName` "
"对象和字符串作为参数，用于创建 `Source` 对象。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/source-map/parse-source-map.ipynb:50014
msgid "`tvm::String GetLine(int line)`：方法，接受整数作为行号，返回对应行的源代码字符串。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/source-map/parse-source-map.ipynb:50015
msgid ""
"`TVM_DEFINE_NOTNULLABLE_OBJECT_REF_METHODS(Source, ObjectRef, "
"SourceNode)`：宏定义，用于声明 `Source` 类的可空对象引用方法。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/source-map/parse-source-map.ipynb:50017
msgid "这些类可以用于表示和操作不同编程语言的程序源代码。"
